        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e1ALR",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A · Three composers",
          "lineHeight": 1.15,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "pbe6l",
          "name": "1 · One line that grows, the recipient inside it",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Fhf2D",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "1 · ONE LINE THAT GROWS, THE RECIPIENT INSIDE IT",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kI7Tx",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A single 32px field. The recipient is a token at its start (click it or type @), the send button sits at its end, and it grows with the text. One line under it says what will happen to the message.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "HsbSc",
          "name": "2 · No card, the draft is the next row of the thread",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DPdPT",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "2 · NO CARD, THE DRAFT IS THE NEXT ROW OF THE THREAD",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tSjJS",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "No box at rest: one hairline, then a row laid out like a message, you → recipient above the text, and below it the state the message will carry once sent. Focused, the row is outlined at 40% accent, with no fill.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "LKROL",
          "name": "3 · The recipient is picked in the team",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "z2Ahck",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "3 · THE RECIPIENT IS PICKED IN THE TEAM",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zafge",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The field holds only text. Clicking an agent in the left column picks the recipient, all is the first row, the picked row says what will happen, and the button names the action and the recipient.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "irvaI",
          "name": "Same in all three",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tFyCI",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "SAME IN ALL THREE",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KlgS8",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Field text at 14, controls at 26 or 32, focus at 40% accent, orange only on the button that sends. Empty and stopped leave the button off. The dead attach button is gone.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
